                                "en": "Without the right care and attention, the patient will slowly <w>waste away</w>."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Door de slopende ziekte zag je hem zienderogen <w>wegkwijnen</w>.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "en": "Due to the debilitating illness, you could see him <w>languishing</w> before your eyes."
